  "manifest": {
    "name": "dsh-kujira",
    "version": "0.2.8",
    "private": true,
    "description": "DeepSeek 鲸鱼娘桌宠 —— 独立重写的 DeepSeek Harness Web 插件。零构建依赖：lib/ 里的 JS 就是源码，改完刷新即生效。",
    "keywords": [
      "dsh",
      "dsh-plugin",
      "deepseek-harness",
      "desktop-pet",
      "mascot",
      "web-ui",
      "cordis"
    ],
    "_comment": [
      "=============== 这个包的清单说明 ===============",
      "type: module            本包是 ESM",
      "main: lib/index.js      宿主半侧入口（Cordis 插件：name / inject / apply）",
      "exports['./client']     浏览器半侧入口；DSH 模块系统按它提供 /plugins/dsh-kujira/client.js",
      "dsh.bundle.patch        声明本包是 bundle，patch 文件 cordis.patch.yml 安装后自动进配置树层栈",
      "dsh.client              声明浏览器半侧的注入依赖与平台（web）",
      "files                   若将来要 npm publish，只发这些",
      "peerDependencies        运行时由 DSH 宿主提供，本包不打包；全部标 optional 避免 pnpm 因解析不到而报错",
      "=============================================="
    ],
    "type": "module",
    "main": "lib/index.js",
    "exports": {
      ".": {
        "default": "./lib/index.js"
      },
      "./client": {
        "default": "./lib/client.js"
      },
      "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
      "./package.json": "./package.json"
    },
    "files": [
