  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "Kujira · 鲸鱼娘",
      "text": "**DeepSeek Harness Web 桌宠插件** — 查看任务进度、会话费用和账户余额，支持峰谷调度、互动养成与独立桌面模式。\n\n[English](README.en.md) · [下载](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases) · [使用说明](docs/USAGE.md) · [桌面模式](docs/DESKTOP.md) · [反馈](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/issues)\n\n[](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases) [](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/actions/workflows/desktop.yml) [](LICENSE)\n\n<img src=\"docs/images/menu.zh.png\" width=\"355\" alt=\"鲸鱼娘发散功能按钮组\" />\n\n<sub>独立预览截图；下方余额面板使用演示金额。</sub>\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 功能特性",
      "text": "- **任务进展** — 显示当前操作、计划和子代理状态，展开查看结果与文件，通过入口跳转到对应会话。\n- **峰谷调度** — 同一 DSH 服务中的主代理和子代理，峰价暂停、谷价续跑。主动发送或单独继续可放行当前任务树至本段峰价结束；默认关闭，在设置中开启。\n- **费用与余额** — 输入框右下方显示峰谷状态和当前会话与嵌套子代理的合计费用；余额读取 DSH 已配置的 DeepSeek 账户。\n- **互动养成** — 130 段同人物透明动画覆盖待机、工作、作息、节日和互动；连续使用物品无冷却，消费按可配置概率掉落物品，可开启无限互动。运行中不调用模型生成回应，也不预加载全部素材。\n- **桌面模式** — Electron 桌面应用独立运行，与浏览器插件共用人物、动画和设置；支持浏览器/桌面显示接管、托盘菜单、透明区域鼠标穿透和置顶，可从人物菜单或托盘按需启动本机 DSH。\n- **个性化** — 调整位置、大小、气泡停留时间和菜单数量；设置自动保存，连续调整防抖；支持中、英、韩、俄及跟随系统。\n- **扩展** — 天气、GitHub 快捷入口，以及供外部插件注册功能的[扩展 API](docs/EXTENSIONS.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ 功能特性",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/images/balance.zh.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"余额面板与鲸鱼娘\" />\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 安装",
      "text": "需要 Node.js 22.13+、pnpm 和可正常运行的 DeepSeek Harness Web，`dsh` 与 `pnpm` 命令须在 PATH 中。\n\n在任意目录执行这一行，macOS、Linux 和 Windows 通用：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases/download/v0.2.8/dsh-kujira-0.2.8.tgz\n```\n\nDSH 自动下载、安装并注册插件，无需 Git、手动解压或进入项目目录。等正在执行的会话完成后，正常重启 DSH Web 并刷新页面。命令固定到明确版本；升级时使用新版发布包地址。\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-kujira\n```\n\n开发者需要链接本地源码时，可使用 `npm run setup`，详见[安装、更新与卸载](docs/INSTALL.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 安装",
      "text": "已在 DSH **0.1.5-rc.1** 验证安装、真实余额与历史会话读取；调度使用该版本的 Agent 事件分发器验证。"
    },
    {
      "section": "📖 使用前了解",
      "text": "- 调度在 **Agent 步骤边界** 生效：已发出的模型请求或执行中的工具会先完成；手动取消的任务不会自动恢复，独立运行的其他 DSH 服务不受控制。\n- 余额查询复用 DSH 凭据服务中的 `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`，需要有效的 DeepSeek 官方 API 密钥；密钥只在宿主使用，不传给浏览器。\n- 天气无需单独配置密钥：城市留空时按 DSH 服务的出口 IP 定位，填写城市则使用该城市；内置国内、国际天气源及失败回退。\n- 切换国家／地区会按 Frankfurter 参考汇率显示人民币、美元、韩元或卢布（约合金额带 ≈ 标记）；实际账户和结算币种保持不变。\n\n更多文档：[调度与补给规则](docs/USAGE.md) · [数据与隐私](docs/PRIVACY.md) · [动画及触发条件](docs/ANIMATIONS.md) · [性能与库存迁移](docs/PERFORMANCE.md) · [桌面模式](docs/DESKTOP.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "🖥️ 可选桌面模式（预览版）",
      "text": "桌面应用可独立运行，通过人物菜单打开本机 DSH；插件安装方式不变，桌面运行环境单独安装。外观与本地养成快照在浏览器/桌面两端同步；库存、奖励及调度仍由 DSH 服务负责，离线不伪造交易。平台边界、默认配置与构建方法见[桌面模式文档](docs/DESKTOP.md)。可选桌面预览包见 [v0.2.8 Release](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases/tag/v0.2.8) 附件；这些预览包未签名。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🛠️ 开发",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm ci --legacy-peer-deps\nnpm run preview   # http://127.0.0.1:8792/\nnpm test          # 含 test:desktop 桌面模块测试\nnpm run lint\n\n桌面应用开发与本地构建：\n\n```bash\nnpm run desktop:install\nnpm run desktop:start\nnpm run desktop:build\n```\n\n无需前端构建。`lib/host` 处理宿主服务，`lib/shared/client` 与 `lib/shared/task` 负责界面，`lib/styles` 存放样式，`desktop/` 为 Electron 桌面应用。类型检查覆盖已标注的模型、资源模块，以及轮询与取消基础设施。库存使用工作线程中的 SQLite 事务，旧 JSON 自动迁移并保留备份。\n\n预览提供状态、费用和长内容示例。任务与费用使用隔离的模拟数据；余额和天气可能访问真实接口。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🤝 参与贡献",
      "text": "欢迎提交 [Issue](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/issues) 和 [PR](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/pulls)：Bug、功能建议、文档修正和代码改进都欢迎，较大的改动建议先开 Issue 讨论。\n\n反馈问题时请附 DSH 版本、复现步骤和必要截图，注意遮盖密钥及私人内容。修改界面时，请检查长文本、小窗口和四种语言。\n\n联系作者：[GitHub @YuluoY](https://github.com/YuluoY) · 个人博客：[uluo.cloud](https://uluo.cloud/)。项目相关问题请优先通过 Issue 沟通。"
    },
    {
      "section": "🌸 致谢",
      "text": "- [yanzwzz/dsh-whale-girl-pet](https://github.com/yanzwzz/dsh-whale-girl-pet) — 动画素材。\n- [PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet](https://github.com/PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet) — 新增同人物动画（MIT 许可随素材提供）与参考实现。"
    },
    {
      "section": "👥 贡献者",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n[](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/graphs/contributors)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "⭐ Star History",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n[](https://www.star-history.com/#YuluoY/dsh-kujira&Date)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "📄 许可",
      "text": "[MIT](LICENSE) © YuluoY。动画保留原作者版权；内置 [i18next](lib/shared/vendor/i18next.LICENSE) 与 [Marked](lib/shared/vendor/marked.LICENSE) 保留各自许可。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "Kujira",
      "text": "**A desktop companion for DeepSeek Harness Web** — track agent tasks, session costs and account balances, with off-peak scheduling, pet interactions and an optional standalone desktop mode.\n\n[简体中文](README.md) · [Releases](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases) · [Usage](docs/USAGE.en.md) · [Desktop mode](docs/DESKTOP.md) · [Issues](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/issues)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Kujira",
      "text": "[](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases) [](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/actions/workflows/desktop.yml) [](LICENSE)\n\n<img src=\"docs/images/menu.en.png\" width=\"355\" alt=\"Kujira radial feature menu\" />\n\n<sub>Isolated preview screenshots. The balance panel below uses demo amounts.</sub>\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ Features",
      "text": "- **Task progress** — current operations, plans and subagents, with expandable results, files and links to their sessions.\n- **Tariff scheduling** — pause main agents and subagents during peak hours and resume off-peak within the same DSH service. Sending a message or choosing Continue releases that task tree until the current peak period ends. Off by default; enable in settings.\n- **Costs and balances** — tariff status and combined parent/subagent costs at the bottom right of the composer; balances from your configured DSH DeepSeek account.\n- **Pet interactions** — 130 transparent clips of the same character covering idle, work, daily routines, holidays and interactions. Continuous use has no cooldown; configurable spending thresholds and probabilities award random bundles, with an unlimited mode. Reactions make no model requests and never preload the full library.\n- **Desktop mode** — a standalone Electron app sharing the mascot, animations and settings with the browser plugin. Browser/desktop display handoff, tray menu, transparent-area click-through, always-on-top and on-demand DSH launch from the mascot menu or tray.\n- **Preferences** — position, size, bubble duration and menu"
    },
    {
      "section": "✨ Features",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"docs/images/balance.en.png\" width=\"600\" alt=\"Balance panel beside Kujira\" />\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 Installation",
      "text": "Requires Node.js 22.13+, pnpm and a working DeepSeek Harness Web installation, with `dsh` and `pnpm` on PATH.\n\nRun one command from any directory on macOS, Linux or Windows:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases/download/v0.2.8/dsh-kujira-0.2.8.tgz\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 Installation",
      "text": "DSH downloads, installs and registers the plugin. No Git clone, manual extraction or project directory is needed. Let active sessions finish, then restart DSH Web and refresh the page. The URL pins an explicit version; use a newer release URL when upgrading.\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web remove dsh-kujira\n```\n\nFor local source development, `npm run setup` remains available — see [installation, updates and removal](docs/INSTALL.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "📦 Installation",
      "text": "Installation, live balances and historical session reads were verified with DSH **0.1.5-rc.1**. Scheduling was tested through that version’s agent event dispatcher."
    },
    {
      "section": "📖 Before you start",
      "text": "- Scheduling takes effect at **agent step boundaries**: an issued model request or running tool finishes first. Manually cancelled tasks stay cancelled; other independently running DSH services are outside its scope.\n- Balance queries reuse `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY` from DSH's credentials service and need a valid official DeepSeek API key. Credentials stay on the host and are never sent to the browser.\n- Weather needs no separate API key: leave the city blank to locate by the DSH server's outbound IP, or enter a city to override it; domestic and international providers include failover.\n- Country selection converts displayed amounts to CNY, USD, KRW or RUB using Frankfurter reference rates (converted amounts show ≈); account and settlement currencies remain unchanged."
    },
    {
      "section": "📖 Before you start",
      "text": "Further docs: [Scheduling and supply rules](docs/USAGE.en.md) · [Data and privacy](docs/PRIVACY.md) · [Animation triggers](docs/ANIMATIONS.md) · [Performance and inventory migration](docs/PERFORMANCE.md) · [Desktop mode](docs/DESKTOP.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "🖥️ Optional desktop mode (preview)",
      "text": "The desktop app runs standalone and opens the local DSH from the mascot menu; plugin installation is unchanged and the desktop runtime is installed separately. Appearance and the local companion snapshot sync between browser and desktop, while inventory, rewards and scheduling stay with the DSH service — no offline transactions are faked. Platform boundaries, defaults and build steps are documented in [desktop mode](docs/DESKTOP.md). Optional unsigned desktop previews are listed in the [v0.2.8 Release](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/releases/tag/v0.2.8) assets."
    },
    {
      "section": "🛠️ Development",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm ci --legacy-peer-deps\nnpm run preview   # http://127.0.0.1:8792/\nnpm test          # includes test:desktop for the desktop modules\nnpm run lint\n\nDesktop app development and local builds:\n\n```bash\nnpm run desktop:install\nnpm run desktop:start\nnpm run desktop:build\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "🛠️ Development",
      "text": "No frontend build is required. Host services live in `lib/host`, UI in `lib/shared/client` and `lib/shared/task`, styles in `lib/styles`, and the Electron app in `desktop/`. Type checking covers annotated models and resource modules. Inventory uses transactional SQLite in a background worker (Node 22.13+); existing JSON inventory migrates automatically and remains as a backup."
    },
    {
      "section": "🛠️ Development",
      "text": "The preview includes task states, cost examples and long-content fixtures. Tasks and costs use isolated demo data; balance and weather panels may call real services."
    },
    {
      "section": "🌸 Credits",
      "text": "- [yanzwzz/dsh-whale-girl-pet](https://github.com/yanzwzz/dsh-whale-girl-pet) — animation assets.\n- [PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet](https://github.com/PC2005-cloud/dsh-pet) — 80 additional same-character animations (MIT, bundled with the assets) and reference implementation."
    },
    {
      "section": "👥 Contributors",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n\n[](https://github.com/YuluoY/dsh-kujira/graphs/contributors)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
